WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 34]

01:40.560 --> 01:43.360
How shall we deal with this situation?

01:43.920 --> 01:45.470
I will launch an investigation.

01:47.920 --> 01:49.639
I'll definitely catch

01:51.599 --> 01:52.759
the traitor.

01:53.920 --> 01:56.000
Fan Xian is the key here.

01:56.440 --> 01:57.800
Since it has come to this,

02:00.319 --> 02:01.579
we have no choice.

02:01.599 --> 02:03.959
We can only side with Li Chengze

02:03.959 --> 02:05.279
and Li Yunrui.

02:05.879 --> 02:07.160
We mustn't hand over

02:07.880 --> 02:09.400
the Three Great Workshops.

02:09.880 --> 02:10.979
To who?

02:10.999 --> 02:12.440
To Fan Xian!

02:15.600 --> 02:17.320
We can't hand them to Li Yunrui

02:19.200 --> 02:20.479
or Li Chengze either.

02:21.600 --> 02:22.880
We need to make them

02:23.480 --> 02:24.919
fight for it.

02:28.280 --> 02:29.799
Only then will the Ming family

02:31.760 --> 02:33.799
be able to survive
through their struggle.

02:38.519 --> 02:40.000
We need to keep

02:42.839 --> 02:44.600
the Three Great Workshops.

02:49.760 --> 02:50.840
You may stop now.

03:02.920 --> 03:04.680
Mother, thank you for your grace.

03:05.040 --> 03:06.560
Hand the needles to me.

03:47.800 --> 03:49.120
Now, I'll go

03:51.519 --> 03:52.959
and keep Li Chengze in check.

03:53.920 --> 03:55.320
He won't stay for long.

03:55.640 --> 03:57.039
Once he leaves,

03:57.719 --> 04:03.070
Jiangnan will still belong to the Ming family.

04:03.399 --> 04:05.000
You're the head of the family.

04:05.999 --> 04:07.600
You may decide that yourself.

04:09.800 --> 04:10.880
Yes, Mother.

04:18.110 --> 04:19.830
Mother, you need to take your nap.

04:20.559 --> 04:21.680
I shall stop

04:23.720 --> 04:25.159
bothering you.

04:54.360 --> 04:55.959
Your Highness, sorry for the wait.

04:56.480 --> 04:58.320
The Ming family is truly resourceful.

04:58.600 --> 05:00.800
You guys even
have palace offerings here.

05:01.239 --> 05:04.240
It's just that you guys
need to learn the rules better.

05:11.679 --> 05:13.159
Have you made your decision?

05:18.960 --> 05:20.480
Your Highness, the Ming family

05:20.920 --> 05:22.719
will stick with you to the end.

05:26.840 --> 05:28.240
There's no one else here.

05:32.360 --> 05:34.219
Mother is indeed taking her nap.

05:34.239 --> 05:35.320
Get up.

05:44.550 --> 05:46.000
Did she not suspect you?

05:51.559 --> 05:52.920
Not yet for now.

05:53.239 --> 05:56.240
But she told me
to investigate the family

05:57.160 --> 06:00.360
to see who's serving you
in secret, Your Highness.

06:02.319 --> 06:04.199
I do have to think of a solution.

06:05.079 --> 06:07.519
I have to see
who's a suitable scapegoat.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.350
I don't know the Ming family well.

06:10.559 --> 06:13.279
Use a distant relative
as your scapegoat.

06:18.480 --> 06:19.619
They aren't suitable.

06:19.639 --> 06:21.079
When it comes to scapegoats,

06:23.800 --> 06:26.000
those brothers of mine
are suitable candidates.

06:30.400 --> 06:32.560
No humans are born without feelings.

06:32.879 --> 06:39.040
When I think about the fact
that I have to push my siblings off a cliff,

06:41.759 --> 06:44.120
I feel disheartened somehow.

06:50.439 --> 06:52.279
It's good to treat people nicely.

06:53.040 --> 06:55.360
I do treat people nicely
when I feel like it.

06:55.720 --> 06:57.900
But sometimes,
giving them a good outcome

06:57.920 --> 07:00.759
and making them look grateful
is more than enough.

07:00.920 --> 07:01.900
Yes, Your Highness.

07:01.920 --> 07:04.159
You mustn't take it to heart.

07:05.720 --> 07:07.320
Everyone has their own destinies.

07:08.639 --> 07:10.079
You can sigh all you like.

07:10.320 --> 07:11.880
I'll return to the Capital now.

07:13.040 --> 07:15.060
Your Highness, you're leaving already?

07:15.080 --> 07:15.999
Why should I remain here

07:16.000 --> 07:17.380
when my task is completed?

07:17.400 --> 07:19.000
But Your Highness, we need you

07:19.239 --> 07:20.859
to oversee the situation in Jiangnan.

07:20.879 --> 07:22.419
The Capital is keeping
a close eye on me as well.

07:22.439 --> 07:24.179
Everything will be over
if His Majesty finds out

07:24.199 --> 07:25.440
that I'm in Jiangnan.

07:26.559 --> 07:28.680
Your Highness,
if you can't remain here for long,

07:28.800 --> 07:29.900
regarding Eldest Princess...

07:29.920 --> 07:32.140
Aunt is visiting her friends.
She won't be able to come.

07:32.160 --> 07:33.959
Fan Xian has all the power in the world.

07:34.119 --> 07:35.380
If both of you aren't around,

07:35.400 --> 07:37.580
I'm afraid the Ming family
can't compete against him.

07:37.600 --> 07:39.159
Xie Bi'an will remain here.

07:43.319 --> 07:44.399
Understood.

07:44.960 --> 07:46.800
I shall ask for Mr. Xie's opinion

07:47.800 --> 07:49.399
before I act in the future.

07:49.439 --> 07:51.519
No need for that.
You may decide that yourself.

07:52.199 --> 07:53.700
What if I lose against Fan Xian?

07:53.720 --> 07:54.959
That's normal too.

07:56.199 --> 07:57.099
Don't overthink it.

07:57.119 --> 07:58.260
Defend the Three Workshops.

07:58.280 --> 07:59.560
Just do your best.

08:03.639 --> 08:04.739
Don't worry.

08:04.759 --> 08:06.219
I'll keep my word.

08:06.239 --> 08:07.410
Once this is over,

08:07.430 --> 08:09.219
only the head
of the Ming family will remain.

08:09.239 --> 08:10.920
The old madam will be history.

08:13.319 --> 08:14.680
Thank you, Your Highness.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.940
Misters, take a break.

08:19.960 --> 08:21.200
Have something to eat.

08:21.319 --> 08:23.260
They're giving us buns!

08:23.280 --> 08:24.480
There are buns here!

08:24.639 --> 08:26.360
Take a break. Let's eat first.

08:29.439 --> 08:30.180
Slowly.

08:30.200 --> 08:31.639
Everyone will get a share.

08:32.200 --> 08:33.299
All of you will receive food.

08:33.319 --> 08:34.760
Slow down.

08:35.420 --> 08:36.359
If you didn't have your fill,

08:36.359 --> 08:37.699
why don't you have another bowl?

08:37.719 --> 08:39.059
May I?

08:39.079 --> 08:39.819
Sure.

08:39.839 --> 08:40.400
Thank you.

08:40.400 --> 08:41.680
Get him another bowl.

08:42.599 --> 08:43.860
Mister, slow down.

08:43.880 --> 08:45.270
We have extra food there.

08:45.800 --> 08:47.800
What do you want to ask me? Ask away.

08:48.040 --> 08:52.740
Are you Mr. Fan,
who came from the Capital?

08:52.760 --> 08:54.860
That's right. I'm Fan Xian.

08:54.880 --> 08:56.400
Thank goodness!

08:56.959 --> 08:58.119
Mr. Fan!

08:58.640 --> 08:59.800
Wait here.

09:00.760 --> 09:02.239
Guys,

09:02.439 --> 09:04.339
this is Mr. Fan!

09:04.359 --> 09:06.059
We got the right ship!

09:06.079 --> 09:07.299
Thank you!

09:07.319 --> 09:09.620
Thank you, Mr. Fan!

09:09.640 --> 09:11.440
Thank you, Mr. Fan!

09:11.839 --> 09:13.230
Thank you, Mr. Fan!

09:13.250 --> 09:14.459
Please have it slowly.

09:14.479 --> 09:15.500
Thank you.

09:15.520 --> 09:16.370
Initially,

09:16.390 --> 09:18.210
we were afraid
that we got the wrong ship.

09:18.230 --> 09:20.290
We would've caused trouble
for that poor soul.

09:21.120 --> 09:24.280
So, how do you guys get rewarded
from raiding our ship?

09:24.959 --> 09:26.839
Someone on the shore is watching us.

09:27.150 --> 09:29.079
As long as we hit
the ship with our tools,

09:29.319 --> 09:30.780
we'll be rewarded.

09:30.800 --> 09:31.550
So, does that mean

09:31.570 --> 09:32.740
you guys will receive the money

09:32.760 --> 09:34.160
after going ashore?

09:35.839 --> 09:37.500
We'll be executed.

09:37.520 --> 09:39.040
There's no turning back.

09:40.880 --> 09:42.479
Why did you guys still come
when you knew

09:42.480 --> 09:43.340
that you would be executed?

09:43.359 --> 09:45.020
We're raiding a government ship.

09:45.040 --> 09:46.579
We'll definitely be executed.

09:46.599 --> 09:48.260
I don't understand something.

09:48.280 --> 09:49.579
Don't you guys want money?

09:49.599 --> 09:51.539
What's the use of getting money
when you'll be executed?

09:51.559 --> 09:53.119
Please don't worry about that.

09:53.920 --> 09:56.359
Our family members will get the money.

09:57.120 --> 09:59.539
We just hope for them to stay safe.

09:59.559 --> 10:01.400
If we earn money for them,

10:01.559 --> 10:03.400
they'll be able to lead a better life

10:03.640 --> 10:06.900
back in Jiangbei.

10:06.920 --> 10:08.090
What about you guys?

10:08.110 --> 10:09.790
Aren't you guys going to head back?

10:09.920 --> 10:11.199
We do wish to head back.

10:11.479 --> 10:13.160
But it's impossible.

10:15.599 --> 10:16.920
It's better

10:17.679 --> 10:19.079
to sacrifice our lives

10:19.559 --> 10:21.160
for our children's future.

10:21.439 --> 10:24.260
It's better than dragging them down
on our way back.

10:24.280 --> 10:26.280
You guys won't be able to survive.

10:26.280 --> 10:28.520
Why didn't you guys
address your grievances?

10:28.839 --> 10:29.919
What?

10:31.359 --> 10:34.119
Actually, you guys
don't need to raid our ship.

10:34.280 --> 10:36.500
As long as you stop our ship
and address your grievances,

10:36.520 --> 10:39.199
Mr. Fan won't ignore you guys.

10:40.240 --> 10:42.199
Sir, it was a natural disaster.

10:42.520 --> 10:44.839
We have no grievances to address.

10:44.959 --> 10:46.040
Old mister,

10:46.400 --> 10:48.179
the Ming family was cornering you guys.

10:48.199 --> 10:49.939
Don't you guys feel that it was unfair?

10:49.959 --> 10:51.039
Mister,

10:51.199 --> 10:52.579
you mustn't say that.

10:52.599 --> 10:54.130
They saved us.

10:54.150 --> 10:55.640
We would've starved to death

10:56.000 --> 10:58.210
had it not been for the Ming family.

10:58.230 --> 10:59.879
Let's forget about them for now.

10:59.920 --> 11:01.560
You guys weren't able to survive.

11:01.580 --> 11:03.180
Why didn't you guys seek help
from the government?

11:03.199 --> 11:04.800
It's not their fault.

11:04.839 --> 11:06.539
We aren't from Jiangnan.

11:06.559 --> 11:09.260
They have to protect their own people.

11:09.280 --> 11:11.680
It makes sense when you think about it.

11:12.599 --> 11:14.440
After hearing that,

11:14.679 --> 11:16.920
I feel like no one is at fault here.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.640
It was a natural disaster.

11:20.079 --> 11:21.920
Who can we blame it on?

11:22.880 --> 11:24.119
Mr. Fan?

11:26.800 --> 11:27.999
Don't you agree?

11:28.599 --> 11:29.679
I agree.

11:39.320 --> 11:41.020
Do you wish to steal power from her?

11:41.040 --> 11:42.440
Or do you want her dead?

11:46.840 --> 11:49.290
My mother has managed
the Ming family for several decades.

11:49.900 --> 11:51.220
She's highly revered within the clan...

11:51.240 --> 11:52.320
Understood.

11:57.839 --> 11:59.640
Do you wish to do it yourself?

12:00.820 --> 12:02.380
Mothers and sons are of one mind.

12:05.390 --> 12:06.579
It's best if I don't do it.

12:06.599 --> 12:07.960
You're quite particular.

12:21.839 --> 12:24.839
The mother swallow
feeds its young with affection.

12:24.920 --> 12:26.160
Say,

12:26.599 --> 12:28.320
between humans and animals,

12:29.030 --> 12:31.270
which of them do you think
cherish their bonds more?

12:36.920 --> 12:38.640
I prefer animals.

13:06.040 --> 13:07.120
Just look at me.

13:07.199 --> 13:08.819
I got carried away from chatting.

13:08.839 --> 13:10.199
I need to get to work now.

13:10.400 --> 13:11.959
They're keeping an eye on us.

13:12.120 --> 13:13.719
I have to hit you.

13:18.319 --> 13:19.399
All right.

13:19.719 --> 13:20.800
You can hit me.

13:25.120 --> 13:26.280
I'll do it now.

13:27.199 --> 13:28.550
Let's move over here.

13:28.570 --> 13:29.879
They can see us better.

13:30.479 --> 13:32.239
It's good that they can see us.

13:33.040 --> 13:34.599
I'll go ahead, then.

13:43.920 --> 13:45.000
Mr. Fan,

13:45.800 --> 13:47.780
why aren't you avoiding my attack?

13:47.800 --> 13:50.560
You need to hit me, right?

13:51.280 --> 13:52.939
It's just an act.

13:52.959 --> 13:55.680
I already raised the stick just now.

13:56.199 --> 13:57.479
You guys could've

13:57.479 --> 13:59.719
just retaliated and finished me off.

14:00.040 --> 14:02.079
Why are you guys staring at me?

14:06.040 --> 14:07.479
Mr. Fan,

14:09.000 --> 14:11.160
pirates are everywhere in Jiangnan.

14:11.359 --> 14:15.299
These bodyguards of yours,
they're pretty mediocre.

14:15.319 --> 14:17.020
You have to get better bodyguards

14:17.040 --> 14:18.479
so that they can protect you.

14:18.760 --> 14:19.800
All right.

14:19.820 --> 14:21.110
I'll get better bodyguards after this.

14:21.120 --> 14:22.599
You must do it, okay?

14:33.280 --> 14:35.040
I'll do it again.

14:36.319 --> 14:37.440
Remember.

14:39.120 --> 14:40.719
Tell them to draw their swords

14:40.839 --> 14:42.079
and slash me for real.

14:49.559 --> 14:52.119
Why don't we have
another bowl of porridge first?

14:52.640 --> 14:53.720
I...

14:57.959 --> 14:58.760
I guess that works.

14:58.760 --> 15:00.190
Let's have another bowl.

15:03.400 --> 15:04.480
Thank you.

15:08.079 --> 15:09.159
Thank you.

15:17.359 --> 15:20.640
What'll happen to Jiangnan
if the Ming family no longer exists?

15:22.599 --> 15:23.879
Mr. Fan,

15:24.599 --> 15:25.879
it'll be the same.

15:26.280 --> 15:27.839
Without the Ming family,

15:28.479 --> 15:31.119
you still have the Zhang family,
the Zhao family, and the Li family.

15:31.319 --> 15:33.079
The Three Great Workshops

15:33.439 --> 15:35.199
are treasure troves.

15:35.959 --> 15:37.400
The one in charge of them

15:38.079 --> 15:40.560
will be the next Ming family.

15:43.679 --> 15:44.839
That's right.

15:45.559 --> 15:47.380
The result will be the same as long as

15:47.400 --> 15:48.839
I return to the Capital.

15:49.390 --> 15:51.150
Even if the Ming family doesn't exist,

15:51.559 --> 15:53.199
the other families will do the same.

15:53.920 --> 15:55.000
Wang.

15:55.280 --> 15:56.220
Yes, Mr. Fan.

15:56.240 --> 15:58.400
Give them some money
and send them ashore.

15:58.439 --> 15:59.519
Understood.

15:59.679 --> 16:00.880
Guys, don't stop accepting the gifts.

16:00.880 --> 16:01.939
Accept whatever gifts they provide.

16:01.959 --> 16:03.039
Yes, Mr. Fan.

16:03.599 --> 16:04.679
Mr. Fan.

16:05.760 --> 16:07.130
Are you sending us back?

16:07.150 --> 16:08.699
You should go home.
Everything will be fine.

16:08.719 --> 16:10.260
Mr. Fan, that won't do.

16:10.280 --> 16:12.400
We already damaged your ship.

16:12.439 --> 16:13.959
You didn't fight us.

16:14.920 --> 16:16.719
And now, you're sending us back?

16:17.400 --> 16:20.059
What about your authority and pride?

16:20.079 --> 16:21.760
You'll be humiliated!

16:23.319 --> 16:24.879
The pride of an official comes

16:25.840 --> 16:27.490
from serving people like you all.

16:38.359 --> 16:39.999
This is a family heirloom.

16:49.839 --> 16:51.070
Descend the carriage.

16:59.280 --> 17:00.880
The head of the Ming family
is here as well.

17:00.880 --> 17:01.960
That's right.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.199
Isn't this...

17:05.240 --> 17:07.000
Yours is pretty good too.

17:07.399 --> 17:08.479
Look.

17:13.440 --> 17:14.520
Mr. Ming.

17:15.800 --> 17:17.439
Greetings, Mr. Ming.

17:19.240 --> 17:21.440
I didn't expect the head
of the Ming family to be here.

17:22.079 --> 17:24.539
Mr. Zhao, your gift
is more precious than mine.

17:24.559 --> 17:25.919
That's right.

17:29.480 --> 17:31.760
Mr. Ming, you're here as well.

17:32.960 --> 17:35.260
Mr. Fan will arrive in Suzhou today.

17:35.280 --> 17:37.500
The officials from the yamen
will come to receive him.

17:37.520 --> 17:39.639
I dare not be absent.

17:39.720 --> 17:40.740
Indeed.

17:40.760 --> 17:41.919
We should be here.

17:44.680 --> 17:47.090
Most of the officials
in Suzhou have arrived, huh?

17:47.110 --> 17:48.790
We have to receive him after all.

17:48.919 --> 17:50.859
Mr. Fan accepted
all the gifts he received.

17:50.879 --> 17:52.460
He's finally arriving today.

17:52.480 --> 17:54.819
Suzhou can't afford
to lose to the other prefectures,

17:54.839 --> 17:56.040
don't you think?

18:00.599 --> 18:02.399
Mr. Fan!

18:02.559 --> 18:05.439
How dare these peasants join us?

18:05.720 --> 18:07.420
These fools are
getting bolder and bolder!

18:07.440 --> 18:09.040
Mr. Fan!

18:09.760 --> 18:11.119
Mr. Fan!

18:11.639 --> 18:12.740
Has Mr. Fan left the ship?

18:12.760 --> 18:14.440
Get down!

18:14.440 --> 18:15.579
That's the one!

18:15.599 --> 18:17.619
That's Mr. Fan's ship!

18:17.639 --> 18:18.359
Get down!

18:18.359 --> 18:19.800
Mr. Fan!

18:24.119 --> 18:25.839
Buddy, I'm sorry.

18:26.159 --> 18:27.399
I'm sorry.

18:27.839 --> 18:29.200
Mr. Fan!

18:30.000 --> 18:31.240
Mr. Fan!

18:31.319 --> 18:32.960
Mr. Fan!

18:33.520 --> 18:34.500
Why hasn't he arrived yet?

18:34.520 --> 18:35.800
He's not here yet.

18:38.800 --> 18:40.639
Are you here to receive Mr. Fan?

18:41.240 --> 18:42.320
That's right.

18:42.639 --> 18:43.539
Listen.

18:43.559 --> 18:45.220
I couldn't sleep last night

18:45.240 --> 18:46.740
when I heard that Mr. Fan was coming.

18:46.760 --> 18:48.280
Don't you think it's ridiculous?

18:49.800 --> 18:51.159
Do you know Fan Xian?

18:51.240 --> 18:52.320
I don't.

18:52.440 --> 18:53.639
But he's my idol.

18:53.760 --> 18:55.800
I idolize both his poems
and personality.

18:55.910 --> 18:57.599
What about you? Are you the same?

18:57.960 --> 18:59.320
Don't you know him?

19:00.720 --> 19:02.919
Should I know him?

19:03.639 --> 19:05.299
You're not from Suzhou, aren't you?

19:05.319 --> 19:06.399
No.

19:06.599 --> 19:08.280
I'm Xu.

19:08.319 --> 19:10.879
I'm the record keeper of Fuchun County.

19:12.639 --> 19:14.200
You're just a record keeper.

19:14.879 --> 19:16.480
How dare you join this event?

19:17.159 --> 19:18.560
As a record keeper,

19:18.850 --> 19:20.660
you should pay attention
to your appearance.

19:20.680 --> 19:21.819
Look at you.

19:21.839 --> 19:23.099
This is highly improper.

19:23.119 --> 19:24.280
Enough already.

19:25.359 --> 19:27.299
Do they all come from Fuchun County?

19:27.319 --> 19:28.020
No.

19:28.040 --> 19:30.159
They come
from different counties in Jiangnan.

19:30.800 --> 19:33.000
Do you guys think
you're worthy enough to join us?

19:33.440 --> 19:35.720
We have official business here.

19:38.040 --> 19:39.599
What kind of official business?

19:39.760 --> 19:40.840
Listen...

19:41.040 --> 19:42.800
Mr. Fan is here!

19:44.280 --> 19:45.700
What are you doing? Get down!

19:45.720 --> 19:46.859
How dare you do this?

19:46.879 --> 19:48.119
Is that Mr. Fan?

19:49.919 --> 19:52.960
Look! He's here! It's Mr. Fan!

19:53.680 --> 19:55.040
He's finally here.

19:55.040 --> 19:58.079
Greetings, Mr. Fan.

20:02.559 --> 20:03.319
Make way!

20:03.319 --> 20:04.720
Guys, make way.

20:29.319 --> 20:30.760
What are these?

20:32.150 --> 20:33.560
There are a few carts of them.

20:40.680 --> 20:41.839
This chest

20:41.940 --> 20:43.780
is filled with jewelry and accessories.

20:47.800 --> 20:51.839
These are gifted by Mr. Yao Qinglian,
magistrate of Shazhou.

20:54.639 --> 20:56.220
This cart

20:56.240 --> 20:58.619
contains the gifts
gifted by the officials.

20:58.639 --> 21:00.439
The names of all the officials

21:01.399 --> 21:03.200
were recorded in a book.

21:16.359 --> 21:17.879
There are that many gifts?

21:18.839 --> 21:20.059
I brought this cart here

21:20.079 --> 21:21.819
from the Capital.

21:21.839 --> 21:25.560
There's a total of 138,888 taels.

21:29.079 --> 21:30.500
All these money

21:30.520 --> 21:32.200
represent our travel expenses

21:32.240 --> 21:33.480
and aspirations.

21:35.680 --> 21:37.260
I'm wealthy.

21:37.280 --> 21:39.020
That's why I'm confident.

21:39.040 --> 21:41.930
As for the gifts given by the officials,

21:41.950 --> 21:43.820
all of these are
evidence of their crime.

21:51.280 --> 21:52.639
Initially,

21:52.919 --> 21:53.680
I thought

21:53.680 --> 21:55.439
of targeting each of the names

21:56.040 --> 21:58.240
one by one
after returning to the Capital.

22:01.520 --> 22:03.800
But on my way to the South,

22:04.200 --> 22:05.639
I saw one thing.

22:06.440 --> 22:07.240
I don't understand

22:07.240 --> 22:09.480
why you guys couldn't see it either.

22:11.319 --> 22:13.399
After I witnessed that,

22:14.399 --> 22:15.879
I changed my thoughts.

22:19.720 --> 22:21.059
These 130,000 taels

22:21.079 --> 22:23.220
and the gifts sent by all the officials

22:23.240 --> 22:24.539
were counted as travel expenses

22:24.559 --> 22:26.800
to send the disaster victims
of Jiangbei home.

22:28.280 --> 22:29.360
Everyone,

22:29.919 --> 22:31.830
I'm new to Jiangnan.

22:31.850 --> 22:33.350
I'm not familiar with the place.

22:33.480 --> 22:35.030
I can't accomplish this task

22:35.119 --> 22:36.740
by myself.

22:36.760 --> 22:38.379
However, I can't leave it

22:38.399 --> 22:39.760
to you guys either.

22:42.079 --> 22:43.339
You guys shouldn't ask me

22:43.359 --> 22:45.320
why I couldn't leave it to you guys.

22:45.760 --> 22:47.379
It's just like I don't ask you guys

22:47.399 --> 22:49.500
why you could put in effort
just to receive me here

22:49.520 --> 22:51.960
when you couldn't see
that the people were suffering.

23:00.399 --> 23:01.520
We should

23:01.720 --> 23:03.240
retain some dignity

23:03.359 --> 23:05.240
for each other.

23:08.440 --> 23:10.720
Since I can't leave
this task to you guys,

23:11.159 --> 23:14.020
I have no choice
but to overstep my boundary

23:14.040 --> 23:15.339
and use another method

23:15.359 --> 23:17.040
to accomplish this task.

23:17.390 --> 23:19.220
Where are the record keepers
of all counties?

23:19.240 --> 23:22.720
Over here!

23:22.879 --> 23:23.700
Over here!

23:23.720 --> 23:26.220
I'm the record keeper of Fuchun County!

23:26.240 --> 23:28.000
I've responded to your invitation!

23:30.440 --> 23:32.480
Greetings, Mr. Fan.

23:32.860 --> 23:35.460
[Record keeper of Fuchun County]
Our county magistrate sends his regards.

23:35.480 --> 23:37.040
Your county magistrate?

23:37.159 --> 23:38.139
Who is he?

23:38.159 --> 23:40.940
He's Mr. Yang Wanli.

23:40.960 --> 23:42.960
Mr. Fan, he's your student.

23:43.440 --> 23:45.170
Yang Wanli is already
a county magistrate?

23:45.190 --> 23:46.940
He just assumed the post not long ago.

23:46.960 --> 23:49.180
Mr. Yang wanted me to relay
this message to you.

23:49.200 --> 23:50.130
As per your quote,

23:50.150 --> 23:51.379
one should be a good person

23:51.399 --> 23:52.619
and a good official.

23:52.639 --> 23:54.480
He never forgot a single word.

23:54.639 --> 23:58.240
Right now, the disaster victims
of Jiangbei still stand a chance

23:58.319 --> 24:00.919
all thanks to you, Mr. Fan.

24:01.200 --> 24:02.399
Don't thank me.

24:02.480 --> 24:03.339
These gifts came

24:03.359 --> 24:04.819
from those officials.

24:04.839 --> 24:07.320
We have to thank them.

24:07.440 --> 24:10.000
Thank you, those officials!

24:11.760 --> 24:13.280
I believe all of you

24:13.280 --> 24:14.159
won't be stingy as well.

24:14.159 --> 24:16.639
We have to thank these officials.

24:16.720 --> 24:19.560
Thank you, these officials.

24:20.960 --> 24:22.280
The gifts

24:22.720 --> 24:24.480
were gifted by the officials.

24:24.720 --> 24:25.800
Everyone,

24:26.280 --> 24:28.020
we have to avoid suspicion.

24:28.040 --> 24:30.400
Therefore, I acted on my own initiative

24:30.420 --> 24:32.660
and invited the record keepers
of all counties in Jiangnan

24:32.680 --> 24:34.079
to Suzhou.

24:34.159 --> 24:36.320
I'll hand the money to them

24:36.340 --> 24:38.780
so that they could distribute them
and relieve the disaster victims.

24:38.800 --> 24:40.359
Dear parent officials,

24:40.599 --> 24:41.740
what do you guys think?

24:41.760 --> 24:42.180
Excellent.

24:42.200 --> 24:43.460
Excellent.

24:43.480 --> 24:45.000
Excellent.

24:45.240 --> 24:47.660
Mr. Fan, you're meticulous indeed.

24:47.680 --> 24:50.180
We'll certainly spare no effort to help.

24:50.200 --> 24:51.639
That's right.
We'll spare no effort to help.

24:51.639 --> 24:53.780
We'll spare no effort to help.

24:53.800 --> 24:55.480
Record keepers, come forward.

25:02.159 --> 25:03.239
Everyone,

25:03.320 --> 25:05.040
record keepers aren't officials.

25:05.079 --> 25:08.480
You guys are closer to the people.

25:08.639 --> 25:10.520
I'll leave it to you guys

25:10.800 --> 25:12.399
to distribute the money.

25:12.720 --> 25:15.919
Mr. Fan, we won't disappoint you.

25:15.960 --> 25:19.240
Mr. Fan, we won't disappoint you!

25:20.399 --> 25:23.059
I'll say this first.

25:23.079 --> 25:25.579
If any one of you is greedy

25:25.599 --> 25:26.819
or intends to do dirty deeds,

25:26.839 --> 25:28.520
you guys better hold it in for now.

25:28.839 --> 25:30.480
You guys can also ask yourself

25:30.760 --> 25:33.679
whether you can pass
the Imperial Inspectorate's inspection.

25:37.280 --> 25:38.439
What's your surname?

25:39.000 --> 25:41.200
My surname is Xu.

25:42.000 --> 25:43.579
I told my men to prepare some ledgers.

25:43.599 --> 25:45.660
However, you guys
are the local record keepers.

25:45.680 --> 25:47.579
Act accordingly to the situation
each county is in.

25:47.599 --> 25:48.540
Mr. Fan, don't worry.

25:48.560 --> 25:50.340
We'll definitely accomplish the task.

25:52.159 --> 25:54.119
If you all wish to join
in this grand endeavor,

25:54.119 --> 25:56.240
I welcome all of you.

25:58.350 --> 26:00.200
But don't hand
the money and gifts to me.

26:00.559 --> 26:01.879
Hand it to them.

26:03.200 --> 26:04.460
That's all I have to say.

26:04.480 --> 26:06.630
There's no need to prepare
a welcoming feast for me.

26:06.879 --> 26:08.320
Please do as you like.

26:09.240 --> 26:10.960
Please look after yourselves as well.

26:27.000 --> 26:28.879
I'm Ming Qingda, the head
of the Ming family.

26:29.000 --> 26:30.639
Greetings, Mr. Fan.

26:31.159 --> 26:34.119
I've heard of your family
even when I was in the Capital.

26:34.319 --> 26:35.720
My family is ordinary.

26:36.080 --> 26:37.820
There's nothing noteworthy about it.

26:40.559 --> 26:42.030
Mr. Fan, please wait a moment.

27:21.919 --> 27:22.999
Mr. Fan,

27:24.280 --> 27:25.720
this is my mother.

27:27.280 --> 27:29.079
Are you two here to welcome me as well?

27:35.879 --> 27:37.480
The Ming family of Jiangnan

27:37.800 --> 27:39.930
is here to apologize
for our crime, Mr. Fan.

27:39.950 --> 27:41.500
What crime have you committed?

27:41.520 --> 27:42.600
Mr. Fan,

27:42.839 --> 27:46.399
Jiangnan was filled with rumors
related to the Ming family and a bounty,

27:46.599 --> 27:49.159
causing you all to be obstructed
throughout your journey.

27:49.359 --> 27:50.370
My mother and I

27:50.390 --> 27:52.379
had to come and apologize
to you the fastest we could

27:52.399 --> 27:55.560
in order to diminish the guilt we feel.

27:55.839 --> 27:56.859
Rumors?

27:56.879 --> 27:57.740
The bounty

27:57.760 --> 27:59.119
didn't exist.

27:59.599 --> 28:01.439
The Ming family only heard about it

28:01.720 --> 28:02.899
after it had happened.

28:02.919 --> 28:04.990
Trying to assassinate
a government official

28:05.010 --> 28:06.780
is equal to breaking
the law of Qing State.

28:06.800 --> 28:07.980
If it's false,

28:08.000 --> 28:10.119
the case cannot be concluded
without a culprit.

28:11.879 --> 28:14.299
Mr. Fan, the Ming family
will definitely locate the culprit

28:14.319 --> 28:15.919
on your behalf.

28:24.440 --> 28:26.119
We need to have a time limit somehow.

28:26.559 --> 28:27.780
What about today?

28:27.800 --> 28:30.099
Mr. Fan, if you're willing to grace
our residence with your presence,

28:30.119 --> 28:31.550
we'll give you an account

28:32.599 --> 28:34.280
before sunset.

28:34.480 --> 28:35.700
It's decided, then.

28:35.720 --> 28:37.359
Mr. Fan, the entire family

28:37.680 --> 28:39.639
will wait for your arrival.

28:40.480 --> 28:41.800
I'm looking forward

28:42.559 --> 28:44.119
to your account.

28:44.680 --> 28:46.399
Mr. Fan, we won't disappoint you.

29:06.680 --> 29:08.040
Do not squeeze!

29:08.359 --> 29:09.500
What's your name?

29:09.520 --> 29:10.159
Do not squeeze! Come!

29:10.159 --> 29:11.239
What's your name?

29:12.079 --> 29:13.240
All right.

29:15.960 --> 29:17.500
Sir, you're highly prestigious.

29:17.520 --> 29:19.919
Seems like the Ming family
is going to join you soon.

29:20.159 --> 29:21.790
Do not jump to conclusions.

29:21.810 --> 29:23.119
Let's just wait and see.

29:23.879 --> 29:25.159
What is this?

29:31.680 --> 29:34.159
You need to pay if you wish
to buy something on the streets.

29:38.359 --> 29:40.240
Take it and play on your own.

29:44.800 --> 29:45.880
This is great.

29:46.000 --> 29:47.760
Mr. Fan, Wanli is able
to help you out now.

29:47.960 --> 29:48.740
He's not helping me out.

29:48.760 --> 29:50.410
He's helping the disaster victims.

29:50.480 --> 29:52.480
Yes, Mr. Fan. You're right.

29:52.760 --> 29:54.320
I just feel sentimental.

29:54.720 --> 29:56.040
Right now, Wanli

29:56.359 --> 29:57.960
has surpassed me.

29:58.919 --> 30:00.280
You can save people too.

30:00.520 --> 30:01.850
One's status isn't important.

30:01.870 --> 30:04.400
Learning how to be a decent person,
that's the important thing.

30:04.879 --> 30:06.220
Yes, Mr. Fan.

30:06.240 --> 30:07.960
I dare not forget your teaching.

30:09.000 --> 30:10.619
It's just that I still have a question.

30:10.639 --> 30:11.410
Ask away.

30:11.430 --> 30:12.859
Sir, you didn't
believe in the officials.

30:12.879 --> 30:15.780
That's why you arranged for those
record keepers to distribute the money.

30:15.800 --> 30:16.599
However, they aren't

30:16.599 --> 30:18.919
necessarily kind people.

30:19.159 --> 30:20.850
What if they take the risk

30:20.870 --> 30:22.420
and make a profit from the operation?

30:22.440 --> 30:23.700
These record keepers

30:23.720 --> 30:25.240
most likely want to become

30:25.240 --> 30:26.260
officials as well.

30:26.280 --> 30:27.839
Making them
help the disaster victims out

30:27.839 --> 30:29.879
is not just a task,

30:30.200 --> 30:32.240
but it's also an opportunity for them.

30:33.800 --> 30:37.040
That's why
they have to do a good job, right?

30:38.159 --> 30:39.599
I understand now.

30:40.000 --> 30:42.919
However, aren't we letting
the corrupt officials off too easily?

30:42.920 --> 30:44.470
Initially, they were supposed
to be arrested.

30:44.480 --> 30:46.120
But now, they've contributed
to the cause instead.

30:46.130 --> 30:48.780
Even if we don't arrest them now, that
doesn't mean we won't do it in the future.

30:48.800 --> 30:50.520
We have their names.

30:51.430 --> 30:53.000
We'll settle the debt later, huh?

30:53.119 --> 30:54.679
Sir, I've learned my lesson.

30:56.879 --> 30:58.000
Where's Wang?

30:58.430 --> 31:00.650
He went to order some dishes
in the restaurant ahead.

31:01.760 --> 31:02.879
He said you tried to look cool

31:02.879 --> 31:03.980
by skipping the welcoming feast.

31:04.000 --> 31:05.630
He thought you must be starving.

31:06.119 --> 31:07.760
I think he's the one starving.

31:29.240 --> 31:30.700
I paid them enough.

31:30.720 --> 31:32.159
That's why the second floor is empty.

31:32.159 --> 31:33.239
Here.

31:33.319 --> 31:34.720
Try their yogurt.

31:38.800 --> 31:41.139
The things in Suzhou are more exquisite.

31:41.159 --> 31:43.240
There are fruits
in the yogurt they serve.

31:46.380 --> 31:48.260
It's better than the ones
in the Capital.

31:55.879 --> 31:58.350
Looks like there are plenty
of experts looking for me today.

31:58.440 --> 32:00.339
Is that so? Where are they?

32:00.359 --> 32:01.439
Look.

32:02.079 --> 32:03.560
That guy, that guy,

32:04.200 --> 32:05.130
this guy,

32:05.150 --> 32:07.250
and this guy, all of them
are martial arts experts.

32:07.280 --> 32:08.360
Sir,

32:08.399 --> 32:09.560
what do you mean?

32:09.639 --> 32:11.839
Those two over there are swordsmen.

32:11.879 --> 32:14.639
As for him, I think he's
hiding a spear in the basket.

32:16.839 --> 32:17.919
As for him,

32:18.800 --> 32:19.800
since he has no weapons,

32:19.800 --> 32:21.520
I assume he's a brawler.

32:21.639 --> 32:23.879
All of them are at least
eighth-grade masters.

32:25.000 --> 32:26.580
There are that many experts here?

32:26.600 --> 32:28.500
I've never witnessed
such a scene before.

32:28.559 --> 32:30.240
Your Highness, you're something else.

32:30.399 --> 32:33.119
You don't cower in the face of danger.
You're pretty gutsy.

32:33.190 --> 32:34.879
We're talking about Mr. Fan here.

32:35.000 --> 32:36.539
I'm sure he expected this to happen.

32:36.559 --> 32:37.639
Am I right, Sir?

32:38.480 --> 32:41.639
It's not like I can predict everything.

32:42.919 --> 32:44.119
This guy over here.

32:47.000 --> 32:48.760
I failed to predict his appearance.

33:03.359 --> 33:05.280
This is a ninth-grade master.

33:06.159 --> 33:09.520
And, he's one
of the top ninth-grade masters.

33:09.639 --> 33:11.839
Why would someone like him
appear in Jiangnan?

33:15.079 --> 33:16.800
He's not fishing.

33:19.960 --> 33:21.320
That's a sword technique.

33:24.800 --> 33:26.679
A ninth-grade blademaster, huh?

33:30.520 --> 33:32.220
There are only a few of them.

33:32.240 --> 33:33.520
If so, who is he?

33:44.240 --> 33:45.320
Mr. Ming!

33:45.480 --> 33:46.599
Mr. Ming!

33:47.520 --> 33:48.020
Mr. Ming!

33:48.040 --> 33:49.230
Fan Xian is resting at a restaurant,

33:49.250 --> 33:51.100
but he's surrounded by martial artists.

33:53.319 --> 33:54.680
Descend the carriage.

34:01.000 --> 34:02.080
Mother.

34:07.599 --> 34:08.679
Mother,

34:08.919 --> 34:11.620
I'm sure Second Prince
left Xie Bi'an here

34:11.640 --> 34:13.080
for a purpose.

34:13.439 --> 34:15.760
If Xie Bi'an doesn't tell us anything,

34:16.519 --> 34:18.200
we can pretend to be ignorant.

34:20.039 --> 34:21.600
With Fan Xian's identity,

34:22.200 --> 34:25.039
I'm afraid ordinary folks
won't be able to take him down.

34:27.319 --> 34:30.839
In this world, there are individuals
who don't care about identities.

34:33.720 --> 34:35.839
Don't tell me it's a grandmaster?

34:37.359 --> 34:40.280
He offended the one
in Dongyi City before.

34:40.600 --> 34:41.919
You mean Sigu Jian?

34:48.200 --> 34:49.399
If,

34:50.720 --> 34:52.280
he does kill him,

34:52.640 --> 34:55.080
our preparation
would've been for nothing.

34:57.080 --> 34:58.660
But when I think about it,

34:58.680 --> 35:01.720
if Sigu Jian does leave Dongyi City,

35:02.439 --> 35:04.120
the entire world will be in chaos.

35:06.240 --> 35:07.399
It's likely

35:07.930 --> 35:09.479
that it's one of his disciples.

35:12.200 --> 35:13.479
I wonder

35:15.399 --> 35:16.760
which disciple is he.

35:22.479 --> 35:23.959
Yun Zhilan.

35:24.800 --> 35:26.959
He's Sigu Jian's eldest disciple.

35:27.120 --> 35:28.339
We met him at Qinian Hall before.

35:28.359 --> 35:30.600
He still has the same killing intent.
It is him.

35:32.319 --> 35:34.800
Yun Zhilan is hard to deal with.

35:35.600 --> 35:36.680
Mr. Fan,

35:36.760 --> 35:38.760
please tell me something.

35:39.839 --> 35:42.339
The martial arts expert
who always protected you all along,

35:42.359 --> 35:43.519
he's here, right?

35:43.919 --> 35:45.080
He vanished long ago.

35:45.080 --> 35:46.859
Now, I only have the Black Cavalries.

35:46.879 --> 35:48.839
Black Cavalries? That won't suffice.

35:48.959 --> 35:50.140
If we do get into a fight later,

35:50.160 --> 35:51.100
I'll use my Qinggong

35:51.120 --> 35:52.280
to help us escape.

35:52.810 --> 35:53.979
Let's decide on a venue first.

35:53.999 --> 35:55.670
I'll rendezvous with you guys later.

35:57.600 --> 36:00.600
Your Highness, you're courageous indeed.

36:00.680 --> 36:03.320
Sir has been teaching me
how to deal with situations.

36:03.340 --> 36:05.790
Firstly, I need to identify
the severity of the situation.

36:05.839 --> 36:08.879
If so, how should we rate
the current situation?

36:10.919 --> 36:12.819
Yun Zhilan hates Sir.

36:12.839 --> 36:13.999
That's severe.

36:14.280 --> 36:15.939
I'm the prince of Qing State.

36:15.959 --> 36:17.720
If a citizen of Dongyi City
dares to attack the prince,

36:17.730 --> 36:18.980
he won't be able
to bear the consequences.

36:18.999 --> 36:20.060
That's not as severe.

36:20.080 --> 36:22.479
At least he doesn't dare
to attack me directly.

36:23.200 --> 36:24.280
Good.

36:24.879 --> 36:26.600
Yun Zhilan,

36:27.600 --> 36:28.999
I would've wanted to spar with you

36:28.999 --> 36:30.800
had I not lost all of my qi flow.

36:31.080 --> 36:33.479
Mr. Fan, what did you say?
Did you lose all of your qi flow?

36:36.519 --> 36:37.140
Wang,

36:37.160 --> 36:39.760
actually,
I forgot to tell you something.

36:39.999 --> 36:41.419
You see, you're the most capable fighter

36:41.439 --> 36:43.080
among us now.

36:43.519 --> 36:45.240
You must be kidding me!

36:48.479 --> 36:50.080
Glutinous rice cake for sale.

36:50.080 --> 36:51.720
Give me two sets.

37:27.400 --> 37:28.359
Why are you keeping your rod

37:28.359 --> 37:29.980
when the fish hasn't taken the bait?

37:41.280 --> 37:42.360
This...

37:42.439 --> 37:43.600
Who's that?

37:44.319 --> 37:45.620
Northern Qi Holy Maiden,

37:45.640 --> 37:47.600
Haitang Duoduo.

37:50.560 --> 37:52.919
No wonder Sir didn't dare
to bring Madam here.

37:54.319 --> 37:55.399
I was wrong.

37:55.519 --> 37:57.439
I'm sure Sir has a clear conscience.

37:58.479 --> 37:59.919
You still need to learn

38:00.240 --> 38:02.399
how to be eloquent.

38:33.399 --> 38:34.999
Who is that?

38:35.479 --> 38:36.499
Northern Qi Holy Maiden,

38:36.519 --> 38:37.800
Haitang Duoduo.

38:42.280 --> 38:44.160
What are you guys peeking at?

38:44.879 --> 38:46.540
I'm admiring the great view of Jiangnan.

38:46.560 --> 38:48.240
I'll clarify one thing.

38:48.560 --> 38:50.160
This has nothing to do with me.

38:50.600 --> 38:51.959
I'm also curious

38:51.999 --> 38:53.600
as to why she's here.

39:32.700 --> 39:34.870
[Yun Zhilan, Disciple
of the grandmaster, Sigu Jian]

39:37.720 --> 39:39.720
Why don't I buy you another rod?

39:39.879 --> 39:41.519
Northern Qi Holy Maiden,

39:41.760 --> 39:43.200
why are you in the Qing State?

39:45.280 --> 39:46.640
Can't I go on a trip?

39:48.240 --> 39:49.379
This has nothing

39:49.399 --> 39:50.680
to do with you.

39:50.879 --> 39:51.959
Leave.

39:52.720 --> 39:55.879
I always wanted to test my strength
against Sigu Jian's sword technique.

39:56.000 --> 39:57.359
Why don't we spar today?

40:06.399 --> 40:07.800
Lord Shadow?

40:20.440 --> 40:22.110
He jumped pretty high, didn't he?

40:31.680 --> 40:34.200
All martial artists under ninth grade,
you all may leave now.

40:36.160 --> 40:37.240
Go back.

40:45.640 --> 40:46.819
You mustn't go upstairs.

40:46.839 --> 40:47.399
Get out of the way.

40:47.399 --> 40:48.839
I know them.

40:54.959 --> 40:56.180
She's one of us.

40:56.200 --> 40:57.280
Miss, please.

40:58.520 --> 41:00.019
Can I have a meal with you guys?

41:00.039 --> 41:01.190
Please have a seat.

41:02.839 --> 41:04.559
Who are they?

41:05.039 --> 41:07.519
We're Mr. Fan's proteges.

41:08.359 --> 41:09.760
Have a seat.

41:09.959 --> 41:11.200
Come.

41:15.439 --> 41:17.039
They're clean. You may use them.

41:19.439 --> 41:21.120
The dishes look pretty exquisite.

41:22.400 --> 41:23.460
The taste is pretty good too.

41:23.480 --> 41:25.210
It's just that the portion is too small.

41:31.920 --> 41:33.840
Did you come to Jiangnan
on a business trip?

41:35.560 --> 41:37.080
Didn't you tell me to come?

41:39.680 --> 41:41.039
What do you mean?

41:41.240 --> 41:42.210
Didn't you write to me

41:42.210 --> 41:44.380
that we were going to do a martial
arts exchange between the states?

41:44.399 --> 41:45.540
I knew you were in Jiangnan.

41:45.560 --> 41:47.120
I brought all the manuals here.

41:47.479 --> 41:48.600
Give me a second.

41:53.280 --> 41:54.360
Here you go.

41:54.825 --> 41:55.600
[One Heaven Knack]

41:55.600 --> 41:57.160
One Heaven Knack?

41:57.959 --> 42:00.600
Isn't this the legendary skill
of Northern Qi?

42:01.039 --> 42:03.030
I did write to you
saying that we should hold an exchange.

42:03.039 --> 42:04.100
But I didn't expect you

42:04.120 --> 42:06.039
to deliver it to Jiangnan yourself.

42:06.959 --> 42:08.180
You're a great friend.

42:08.200 --> 42:09.230
I'll deliver one to you later.

42:09.240 --> 42:10.020
What will you deliver to me?

42:10.039 --> 42:11.479
My Dominant Qi manual.

42:11.959 --> 42:12.740
What's wrong?

42:12.760 --> 42:13.879
This is supposed to be an exchange.

42:13.880 --> 42:15.140
I have to give you one in return.

42:15.160 --> 42:16.240
Enough already.

42:18.560 --> 42:20.320
Thank you so much.

42:21.080 --> 42:23.260
It's been some time since we met.
You're more dramatic now.

42:23.280 --> 42:23.979
That's not it.

42:23.999 --> 42:25.479
I know how precious

42:25.479 --> 42:26.879
the One Heaven Knack is.

42:26.959 --> 42:28.280
I never expected you to give it to me

42:28.290 --> 42:29.780
even though I only wrote you a letter.

42:29.800 --> 42:31.280
We're great friends indeed.

42:31.960 --> 42:33.519
I heard that you got married.

42:37.340 --> 42:39.030
You can take it as your wedding gift.

42:39.800 --> 42:41.240
But this is too precious.

42:41.839 --> 42:43.160
I thought so too.

42:44.190 --> 42:45.380
I couldn't bear to part with it.

42:45.400 --> 42:46.899
My teacher told me to deliver it to you.

42:46.919 --> 42:49.379
Master Ku He told you
to deliver this to me?

42:49.399 --> 42:49.919
You don't say?

42:49.919 --> 42:51.519
Did you think I stole it from him?

42:52.399 --> 42:54.600
Do all masters give out
such precious gifts?

42:55.760 --> 42:57.760
You're Ye Qingmei's son after all.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
